WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.350
- Everyone loves you,
you've done so many things,

00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:04.340
but, do people, like, out
of all your stuff though,

00:00:04.340 --> 00:00:05.670
do people, when you're
in a hardware store,

00:00:05.670 --> 00:00:06.744
do they still do--

00:00:06.744 --> 00:00:08.202
(Tim and Kelly imitating
dog sounds together)

00:00:08.202 --> 00:00:09.300
Do they, yeah, yeah.

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:10.450
- It's, "Grunt for me!"

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:12.133
Y'know, like I'm a little--

00:00:12.133 --> 00:00:14.420
one of those little monkeys
that does this, y'know.

00:00:14.420 --> 00:00:15.253
- [Kelly] Oh, they ask you?
- But it--

00:00:15.253 --> 00:00:16.317
Yeah, they come and--

00:00:16.317 --> 00:00:19.820
"Run for me, show the kids,"
or a cop pulls me over,

00:00:19.820 --> 00:00:22.310
'cause I have a very high performance car,

00:00:22.310 --> 00:00:23.930
and it was making too much
noise, and as soon as the window

00:00:23.930 --> 00:00:25.760
goes down he goes-- (imitating dog sound)

00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:29.230
(audience laughs)
- [Tim] And I gotta get--

00:00:29.230 --> 00:00:30.220
But I'm--

00:00:30.220 --> 00:00:31.933
- Hey, if they let you
out of the ticket, I'd--

00:00:31.933 --> 00:00:32.974
(imitating dog sound)
- Well, it actually--

00:00:32.974 --> 00:00:33.807
- All day long.

00:00:33.807 --> 00:00:36.570
- It actually didn't, 'bout
done'em, so I got a double,

00:00:36.570 --> 00:00:37.420
but I'm up in--

00:00:37.420 --> 00:00:40.260
what is it, Sacramento, and my
wife and I were going through

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:43.210
town and a guy who crossed
the street goes, "Oh, hey!"

00:00:43.210 --> 00:00:45.750
Which I like that people
think I have to turn around

00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:47.597
when they just yell across the--

00:00:47.597 --> 00:00:50.070
"Hey! Hey!"
(audience laughs)

00:00:50.070 --> 00:00:52.633
And of course I do, and he goes, "Do you--

00:00:52.633 --> 00:00:54.997
(grunting sounds)

00:00:54.997 --> 00:00:56.019
"Tool belt!"

00:00:56.019 --> 00:00:58.380
(audience laughs)
- [Kelly] Tool belt, like why?

00:00:58.380 --> 00:01:01.690
- Just gets yelled, I go, "What?"

00:01:01.690 --> 00:01:03.550
He couldn't quite get the show but it has

00:01:03.550 --> 00:01:05.957
something to do with tools and
it was tool belt, and I went,

00:01:05.957 --> 00:01:07.150
"Claw hammer!"

00:01:07.150 --> 00:01:08.380
- [Kelly] Claw ha-- (laughs)
(audience laughs)

00:01:08.380 --> 00:01:10.250
- We went back and forth, I--

00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:11.400
I get it--
- Shovel!

00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:12.550
- Yeah, shovel.

00:01:12.550 --> 00:01:15.560
In this world, it's not like
it was in Home Improvement,

00:01:15.560 --> 00:01:18.630
Home Improvement was, I believe
at our top, were 24 million

00:01:18.630 --> 00:01:19.860
viewers on a Tuesday night.

00:01:19.860 --> 00:01:22.360
- Yeah, but it's true that it
was such a remarkable thing,

00:01:22.360 --> 00:01:23.230
that show, I think--

00:01:23.230 --> 00:01:25.700
You've done so many amazing
things, but that show was a huge

00:01:25.700 --> 00:01:27.070
staple for a lot of people,
that's why they still--

00:01:27.070 --> 00:01:28.910
- Well, they did, we did a show--

00:01:28.910 --> 00:01:30.740
We got away with stuff, I think, we did--

00:01:30.740 --> 00:01:33.890
They did a show on the
Space Shuttle Endeavour

00:01:33.890 --> 00:01:36.540
live simulcast on Home
Improvement, we had all the as--

00:01:36.540 --> 00:01:37.440
- I missed that one.

00:01:37.440 --> 00:01:40.010
- Oh god, it was, 'cause it
looked like it was phony,

00:01:40.010 --> 00:01:43.120
and they were floatin' around
in there doing a Tool Time,

00:01:43.120 --> 00:01:44.610
on the, it was the mo--

00:01:44.610 --> 00:01:46.060
I've got all the stuff at my shop--

00:01:46.060 --> 00:01:46.893
- [Kelly] What?
- [Tim] I'm just amazed,

00:01:46.893 --> 00:01:48.560
I'm a space freak.
- [Kelly] I'm a space nerd.

00:01:48.560 --> 00:01:50.327
- I just love that stuff, and I said,

00:01:50.327 --> 00:01:54.710
"What kinda money was this,
who did this," where they're

00:01:54.710 --> 00:01:55.890
floatin' around 'cause it was--

00:01:55.890 --> 00:01:57.880
the joke was I was doing a
Tool Time and they're all

00:01:57.880 --> 00:02:00.150
sleeping 'cause it was so
boring, 'cause they just--

00:02:00.150 --> 00:02:01.150
they'd just be floatin' arou--

00:02:01.150 --> 00:02:04.380
but they did it live from
the Endeavour Space Shuttle

00:02:04.380 --> 00:02:05.523
down to Earth.
- [Kelly] That's so cool!

00:02:05.523 --> 00:02:07.137
- Cool is not the word for it.

